[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]Unholy Genessa v0.3.1[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[b]Added[/b]
[list]
[*]Expand body shaping from six to 24 controls, including more chest, waist, hip and leg adjustments.
[*]Add body-motion Travel controls and support the CSS 1.0.2 motion settings.
[*]Expose the 24 body morphs to UUEPBS; the optional Mortal Shell II profile also recognizes the chest bones.
[/list]

[b]Changed[/b]
[list]
[*]Add gradual resistance near the motion limit. Further motion-feel tuning is still in progress.
[/list]

[b]Fixed[/b]
[list]
[*]Restore materials that appeared gray or lost their textures after the October 20 game update (build 26073152).
[/list]

[b]Upgrading[/b]
[list]
[*]Close the game. Replace CSS_UnholyGenessa_eins0fx_P under MortalShell2/Content/Paks/~mods/ with the complete folder from this download.
[*]Install CSS 1.0.2 and CSS Shared Assets 1.0.2 alongside this update.
[*]Remove an older standalone CSS shader-fix overlay for this outfit if you installed one. Keep your CSS settings and profiles.
[/list]

Body-motion feel is still being refined. Large body changes can cause clothing to clip; Unholy Genessa's simulated skirt does not yet follow every new shape adjustment.
